# 🛡️ Project Overview

This project is a hands-on cybersecurity and IT infrastructure lab designed to simulate a real-world enterprise network environment. It uses Windows Server 2019 as a Domain Controller and multiple Windows 10 client machines.

The lab showcases:
- Active Directory structure
- Organizational Units (OUs)
- Role-based Security Group implementation
- Group Policy Objects (GPOs) for access control
- Custom desktop environments
- VirtualBox network configuration (host-only)

🔧 Tools Used:
- VirtualBox
- Windows Server 2019
- Windows 10
- Group Policy Management Console
- Command Prompt (gpresult, ping, nslookup)
